  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDeception Warning Study — run-level benchmark results\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains run-level rows for the controlled benchmark on warning placement for web agents under deceptive interfaces (ShopLane / WorkHub tasks).\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tContents\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nFile\nDescription\n\n\n\t\t\nrun_level.parquet\nHub-friendly columnar format (recommended)\n\n\nrun_level.jsonl\nOne JSON object per run\n\n\nrun_level.csv\nSame data as CSV\n\n\nexport_meta.json\nExport metadata: column list, row count, schema version\n\n\n\t\n\nCurrent… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/deceptive-web/deception-warning-study-runs.",
